WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.309
What is going on there?

00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:04.330
I don't look like that.

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:05.350
Do I look like that?

00:00:07.970 --> 00:00:11.369
This year, we've seen an explosion in different AI products, things like ChatGPT.

00:00:11.390 --> 00:00:14.630
for text. We've seen AI voice simulators.

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:17.800
A few companies, though, are selling AI headshots.

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:26.910
The idea is you take a few photos on your phone, upload them to the cloud, and then with AI magic, you get a whole host of different AI-generated headshots.

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:27.979
These are hilarious.

00:00:28.730 --> 00:00:34.759
We're going to take a look and see if we can update my LinkedIn profile with one of these headshots and compare it to photos that my producer took.

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:35.970
Let's try it out.

00:00:38.210 --> 00:00:38.450
Okay.

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.310
So the they offer three different prices.

00:00:40.310 --> 00:00:43.729
There's a $29 version, $39 version, $69 version.

00:00:43.730 --> 00:00:48.379
We're going for the $39 version and you get 120 headshots in three different styles.

00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:52.249
The credit card number is – wait, should we say that on camera or...

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:54.819
So there's a few different options now.

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:57.040
You can select outdoors or indoors.

00:00:57.040 --> 00:00:59.229
You can select where the photos are being taken.

00:00:59.230 --> 00:01:03.310
So there's a park, a building, woods, and then you can select the clothing.

00:01:03.310 --> 00:01:07.390
We're going to go with with a polo. Nice, classy, professional, not too professional.

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:12.445
So it says on the site that it recommends using a professional camera to take your pictures, which you'll upload.

00:01:12.445 --> 00:01:17.290
Which is a bit ironic because if you have a professional camera, you could just take professional photos of yourself.

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:21.969
We're actually just going to do it with an iPhone and we're going to see if iPhone selfie pics can do the trick.

00:01:23.110 --> 00:01:24.640
All right, let's upload these photos.

00:01:26.120 --> 00:01:27.969
We just got a notice that the photos are ready.

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:28.940
I haven't seen them yet.

00:01:28.940 --> 00:01:31.610
Here are my AI-generated headshots.

00:01:32.720 --> 00:01:33.720
Whoa.

00:01:33.980 --> 00:01:37.160
That looks like me, but mega jacked.

00:01:37.190 --> 00:01:39.290
I do not have that chest.

00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:40.160
Wow.

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:41.540
Here's a necklace it gave me?

00:01:41.630 --> 00:01:42.630
A little necklace?

00:01:42.980 --> 00:01:46.030
Okay, so we're looking at them in a grid, right?

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:47.269
Which means that they're not close up.

00:01:47.570 --> 00:01:50.169
And that looks perfect in that size.

00:01:50.180 --> 00:01:57.449
When I click on it, you can start to see that there is some kind of computer-generated funny stuff going on.

00:01:57.470 --> 00:01:58.010
Like, it's...

00:01:58.010 --> 00:01:59.599
It's too smooth.

00:01:59.870 --> 00:02:02.930
It just doesn't feel totally right.

00:02:03.350 --> 00:02:03.860
Okay.

00:02:03.860 --> 00:02:04.460
All right.

00:02:04.460 --> 00:02:05.460
We found our first weird one.

00:02:06.440 --> 00:02:12.379
My AI avatar was having a rough night when this photo was taken in AI land.

00:02:12.740 --> 00:02:15.770
If I was going to hire someone and I saw this photo, I would not hire them.

00:02:15.980 --> 00:02:17.360
I didn't even have to hit rock bottom.

00:02:17.510 --> 00:02:18.949
AI gets to show me what it looks like.

00:02:18.950 --> 00:02:19.550
So that's –

00:02:19.550 --> 00:02:20.360
That's pretty good.

00:02:20.360 --> 00:02:21.500
If it's the mother test.

00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:22.749
Would it fool your mom?

00:02:22.760 --> 00:02:24.229
That could pass the mother test.

00:02:24.440 --> 00:02:26.910
What should I say? Just got this headshot taken. What do you think?

00:02:27.170 --> 00:02:28.340
That doesn't look like me.

00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:31.200
I don't look like that.

00:02:31.940 --> 00:02:33.800
Yeah, it's me as Salt Bae.

00:02:33.830 --> 00:02:35.150
As an Italian Salt Bae.

00:02:36.370 --> 00:02:39.399
My sister responded, "You look handsome, but it's pretty squinty."

00:02:39.520 --> 00:02:41.860
And my brother said, "I think the hair is just a little off."

00:02:41.890 --> 00:02:43.060
"Put that in the next prompt."

00:02:43.090 --> 00:02:44.090
Yeah, he [laughs]...

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:49.899
So here are the photos that my producer John G took.

00:02:49.910 --> 00:02:52.949
So these are real photos captured by a real camera.

00:02:52.970 --> 00:02:58.069
Let's see how they compare to the AI photos cooked up by some cloud computing server somewhere.

00:02:58.460 --> 00:02:59.930
This is the one that I sent my mom.

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:02.000
Expression wise, I mean, that is me.

00:03:02.180 --> 00:03:02.630
Compare.

00:03:02.630 --> 00:03:04.430
Here we can look at some of the more real photos.

00:03:05.180 --> 00:03:06.710
There's kind of more pensive look.

00:03:07.130 --> 00:03:08.689
My hairline is a little different.

00:03:08.720 --> 00:03:12.289
It's giving me blue eyes in the AI one, which...brown.

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:16.129
One of the issues with these photos is that they're, like, too realistic.

00:03:16.160 --> 00:03:18.080
There's like, this kind of hyper realism to it.

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:20.800
And it's it's hard to even describe, but it's kind of those things

00:03:20.810 --> 00:03:22.280
it's like once you see it, you know it.

00:03:24.130 --> 00:03:26.279
So on LinkedIn, your photo is small, right?

00:03:26.290 --> 00:03:30.520
And the smaller the photo is, the easier it is for it to go undetected by human eye.

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:31.810
On LinkedIn the photo's small. Right?

00:03:31.810 --> 00:03:34.180
Like you might be able to get away with it, but I'm not going to do it.

00:03:34.240 --> 00:03:38.620
So we went with the real photo taken by a real camera, but everybody might not have access to that.

00:03:38.620 --> 00:03:42.564
So if you just have your iPhone and you want to take some pictures and put them in the AI machine,

00:03:42.565 --> 00:03:46.809
know that the photos could work. Right?

00:03:46.810 --> 00:03:50.590
If someone doesn't take too close a look, you might be able to get away with it.

